---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<Base title="About" description="About Hussain MS: IIT Kharagpur engineer working on data, digital public infrastructure and AI for public health in India.">
<header class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow" style="--dot:var(--yellow)">About</div>
    <h1>Hussain</h1>
  </div>
</header>
<div class="wrap about-grid">
  <article class="prose" style="--c:var(--yellow)">
    <p>I am a digital development professional and a graduate of IIT Kharagpur. I work where data, technology and public systems meet, helping governments and development institutions design and deliver programmes that achieve their intended outcomes.</p>
    <p>I am currently a Senior Consultant at <strong>Deloitte</strong>, working as a consultant to the <strong>Asian Development Bank</strong> on India's National Urban Health Mission. My work covers data strategy, digital transformation, AI policy, GIS-based tools and the design of digital products for public programmes.</p>
    <p>In nearly five years, I have worked with multilateral development banks, UN agencies, international NGOs, donor-funded programmes and governments, across both strategy and implementation.</p>
    <p>I grew up in Hyderabad, India. Outside work, I enjoy football, Formula 1 and theatre.</p>
    <p><a class="btn cv" href={`mailto:${site.email}?subject=CV%20request`} style="text-decoration:none;margin-top:8px">Request my CV →</a></p>
  </article>
  <aside>
    <figure class="photo"><picture><source srcset="/img/hussain-ms.webp" type="image/webp"><img src="/img/hussain-ms.jpg" alt="Portrait of Hussain MS" width="800" height="800"></picture></figure>
    <h2 class="side-h">Education</h2>
    <ul class="timeline">
      <li><span class="when">2016–2021</span><b>IIT Kharagpur</b><span>B.Tech + M.Tech, Biotechnology &amp; Biochemical Engineering</span></li>
      <li><span class="when">2020</span><b>GATE: All India Rank 209</b><span>National postgraduate engineering examination</span></li>
      <li><span class="when">2016</span><b>JEE Main: All India Rank 256</b><span>National engineering entrance examination</span></li>
    </ul>
    <h2 class="side-h">Work</h2>
    <ul class="timeline">
      <li><span class="when">Mar 2026 – now</span><b>Asian Development Bank</b><span>Consultant (Data Strategist), National Urban Health Mission</span></li>
      <li><span class="when">Sep 2025 – now</span><b>Deloitte</b><span>Senior Consultant, Government &amp; Public Services</span></li>
      <li><span class="when">Jan 2022 – Sep 2025</span><b>PATH</b><span>Engineer → Associate → Senior Associate</span></li>
    </ul>
    <h2 class="side-h">Recognition</h2>
    <ul class="timeline">
      <li><span class="when">2023</span><b>PATH ACE Team</b></li>
      <li><span class="when">2022</span><b>PATH Vision Award</b></li>
      <li><span class="when">2019</span><b>Elected General Secretary</b><span>JCB Hall, IIT Kharagpur</span></li>
      <li><span class="when">2018</span><b>Best Volunteer</b><span>National Service Scheme, IIT Kharagpur</span></li>
    </ul>
  </aside>
</div>
</Base>
